{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284290","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028429001:1":{"text":"돌아오셨군요. 실종된 식물학자는 찾으셨어요? 그들은 무사한가요?!","source_cn":"你们回来了，找到那两个失踪的植物学家了吗？他们还安全吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD79DFC98B0CDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028429002:1":{"text":"사람을 찾긴 찾았는데...","source_cn":"人倒是找到了，不过嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6737BE61F02B7FCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1028429002":{"text":"사람을 찾긴 찾았는데...","source_cn":"人倒是找到了，不过嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6737BE61F02B7FCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028429003:1":{"text":"우리가 이용당한 거군요! 어휴, 대원들을 괜히 고생시켰어요...","source_cn":"原来我们是被利用了！唉，让队员们平白受了不少苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2988061B91040B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028429004:1":{"text":"흥, 그 블랙골드 상회 녀석이 부패의 고통을 겪었어야 했는데!","source_cn":"哼，应该让黑金商会那家伙也尝尝被腐蚀生病的滋味！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD21613FD15396B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028429004":{"text":"흥, 그 블랙골드 상회 녀석이 부패의 고통을 겪었어야 했는데!","source_cn":"哼，应该让黑金商会那家伙也尝尝被腐蚀生病的滋味！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD21613FD15396B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028429005:1":{"text":"감사합니다! 마을에 도착할 때까지 버티지 못할까 봐 걱정했는데 이제 안심이에요.","source_cn":"谢谢你们！我刚才还担心大家撑不到回村子呢，这下就放心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5C95D799B6D3B8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028429006:1":{"text":"목재를 기다리는 마을 사람들이 화내지 않았으면 좋겠네요...","source_cn":"只希望回到村子以后，那些等着用梁木的村民们别太生气……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBD8DB1856683C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028429007:1":{"text":"아, 맞다! 마을에서 집을 고치려는 아저씨가 아직도 기다리고 있어요!","source_cn":"——啊，对哦！村里准备翻盖房子的大叔还在等着呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24B3EAA8BC1E7F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028429008:1":{"text":"채집대를 더 보내야겠군요. 이변이 없는 한 장마철이 오기 전까지 목재를 충분히 공급할 수 있을 겁니다.","source_cn":"我会再派出一支采集队。只要不再出现意外，雨季前还来得及...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7014ED04456B49D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028429009:1":{"text":"벌목에다가 부패까지... 안타깝게도 벌목장이 아주 만신창이가 됐네요.","source_cn":"可惜，林地又是被砍伐，又是被腐化，现在看上去满目疮痍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E21CC7030939085","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028429010:1":{"text":"대장으로서 임무도 제대로 완수하지 못하고 벌목장만 이렇게 훼손했으니...","source_cn":"我没能带队完成这次的任务，反而把林场破坏成了这个样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE70A614652CB332","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028429011:1":{"text":"당신의 잘못이 아니에요! 과감하게 명령을 내리고 용감하게 책임을 졌잖아요! 그것만으로도 이미 훌륭해요!","source_cn":"但这不是你的错！你能果断下令和勇于承担责任，已经做得很好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D3446BC319B722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028429012:1":{"text":"채집대 대장인 당신이 우리의 터전에 더 자신감을 가져야죠. 이것 보세요...","source_cn":"队长先生，你应该对我们的家园有更大的信心呀。你瞧——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12A545F5A8DE971","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028429013:2":{"text":"나무줄기는 잘려나갔어도, 뿌리는 흙 속에 단단히 자리를 잡고 있어요. 여전히 살아 숨 쉬고 있고, 자라나고 있죠.","source_cn":"林场中的树木，即使树干被砍伐了，根系都还牢牢地扎在土壤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B921318A4AA1272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028429014:1":{"text":"그리고 새싹은 언제나처럼 나무에서 돋아날 거예요.","source_cn":"而新芽总会从旧木上长出。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA744DEF9A85F6305","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028429015:1":{"text":"그러니 걱정하지 마세요. 언젠가 이곳에 다시 커다란 나무가 자라날 테니까요.","source_cn":"放心吧，终有一天，这里会重新长满参天大树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8221660E2497537F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"(진정 포션을 건넨다)","source_cn":"（递给他缓和药剂）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48FA1D69727F5023","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(진정 포션을 건넨다)","female":"(진정 포션을 건넨다)","variant_male_record_index":"61426","variant_female_record_index":"61427","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"(자초지종을 설명한다)","source_cn":"（向他说明事情原委）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25231C6CA3570ACD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(자초지종을 설명한다)","female":"(자초지종을 설명한다)","variant_male_record_index":"61424","variant_female_record_index":"61425","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:队长西奥多":{"text":"대장 테오도르","source":"队长西奥多","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"fl